s. Run through the trees, climb around the environment, and enjoy the simple, energetic gameplay that makes every movement feel exciting.\n\nThis is just the beginning \u2014 **more maps and new areas are planned for future updates**, giving players even more places to explore and play together.\n\nIsraTag is built for the Israeli VR community and fans who love social VR experiences, movement-based gameplay, and exciting worlds to discover.\n\nGrab your headset, enter the forest, and join the growing community of Israeli VR fans in IsraTag.\n", "short_description": "IsraTag is a gorilla tag fangame for israeli gtag lovers!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1y7AtbsC6AlOl9UtQjUThBnlKzQpV6db_xOXB0Dsek_c/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "MonkeMonkStudios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1eiQmNJaI4o7adtymhECkmm5lPXaYO_c-w0NTCCgnlfM/edit?usp=sharing", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "MULTI_USER", "CO_OP", "MULTI_USER"], "id": "26375944475359214"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "985858827439545"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "985858827439545"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1775852880, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "98585882743